- that A7, the cell graph, edge weights or the interaction functional are uniquely derived from the primordial FIN ontology;
- that the conditional cycle geometry is physical space, uniquely selected, 3+1-dimensional or Lorentzian;
- that causal event depth is a physical clock, SI time or a thermodynamic arrow;
- that the dimensionless variational functional is physical energy without a generator/bath and an energy anchor;
- that the soft mode is a particle, photon, Goldstone mode or propagating field without an added kinetic law;
- that the controlled linear collective theory contains stable transported matter-like patterns;
- that information recovery on a Gibbs family implies universal information conservation;
- that complex amplitudes, phase interference or reversible maps derive quantum mechanics;
- that FIN currently violates Bell/CHSH or supplies entanglement/Born structure;
- that graph deformation is gravity or that GR/Newton's constant/equivalence have been derived;
- that the q-extension is a spatial continuum or that q, N, M, rank and refinement are interchangeable;
- that the generic simple-fold exponents or the 1/6 fold combination are distinctive FIN predictions;
- that the synthetic measurement protocol is empirical validation;
- that completion of the numbered campaign means a theory of nature is complete.

The strongest current status is a **falsifiable conditional effective-model architecture** plus several no-go/nonidentifiability theorems. Fundamental model selection remains blocked by PHY-013 / SO-PHY-012-01.
